ditional)","historical_business_count":2},{"category":"American (New)","historical_business_count":2},{"category":"Burgers","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Venues & Event Spaces","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Cajun/Creole","historical_business_count":4},{"category":"Lounges","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Cocktail Bars","historical_business_count":2},{"category":"Nightlife","historical_business_count":5},{"category":"Seafood","historical_business_count":2},{"category":"Restaurants","historical_business_count":8},{"category":"Event Planning & Services","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (New), American (Traditional), Bars, Cajun/Creole, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":7},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"jQPg8OKiSVa-fwvd-XGzLQ","review_id":"3vgjuxeRzrvevN44Vc83DA","date":"2019-05-05T21:58:25","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9422597885131836,"text_excerpt":"Cannot say enough good things about this place. We were panicked at the prospect of weeding out all the restaurants in New Orleans for one night and trying to pick the best. Luckily this was in the French Quarter, where we wanted to end up, and seemed to have all the seafood options we wanted to try on the menu. Plus the option of a courtyard in the back was too precious to pass up. I'm so glad we came here! We arrived just before their happy hour ended so I ordered the pork rinds with pimento cheese spread special along with two moscow mules for 5$ each!!! Jesus was I happy we happened to go at the right time. Those pork rinds were dreamable worthy. I don't know if I'll ever be able to f..."},{"business_id":"jQPg8OKiSVa-fwvd-XGzLQ","review_id":"rGmrFNg2ZHGQgnaNvyyd9g","date":"2021-06-12T03:46:01","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9381738901138306,"text_excerpt":"I'd been wanting to try this place for a while and finally got the chance tonight :) It did not disappoint. While we only went for apps and happy hour drinks, we were so satisfied. The drinks were strong, the meat pies are homemade and fantastic, but what really makes this place is the service. We sat at the bar and immediately felt like family. Richie took great care of us and the rest of the staff hung out and offered recommendations as well! Very cool French Quarter spot off the beaten path. We can't wait to come back for a meal and enjoy their entrees and their lovely courtyard."},{"business_id":"jQPg8OKiSVa-fwvd-XGzLQ","review_id":"yRq8z0vfB_-PnO6bHlIr-Q","date":"2018-02-25T12:59:59","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9376466870307922,"text_excerpt":"We loved this place!! We sat outside in the courtyard for dinner & had a great waitress whose recommendations were all spot on. The fried green tomatoes-served with crab-was so yummy! We then had the shrimp & grits which was PERFECT (my friend & I shared cuz it was huge) and ended with quite possibly the best dessert I've ever had: bread pudding beignets. This blows Cafe Du Mondu out of the water & is so so delicious without being overly heavy. Drinks were just ok, in my opinion, but with all the drinking we did in NOLA, I was ok with not loving my drink here! As you know, there are a trillion great options in NOLA for dining; this definitely makes my repeat list for next time!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"jQPg8OKiSVa-fwvd-XGzLQ","photo_id":"qTzN7udNNxPxxsI-BCnlwA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/qTzN7udNNxPxxsI-BCnlwA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8961155414581299},{"business_id":"jQPg8OKiSVa-fwvd-XGzLQ","photo_id":"EyFWPsJI91jtvnLwrcYzSQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/EyFWPsJI91jtvnLwrcYzSQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8908116817474365},{"business_id":"jQPg8OKiSVa-fwvd-XGzLQ","photo_id":"WLK_MPsEoAFvhvLw9_mKfw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/WLK_MPsEoAFvhvLw9_mKfw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.871632993221283},{"business_id":"jQPg8OKiSVa-fwvd-XGzLQ","photo_id":"TjoEiztpC7of5NLmJNjcFg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/TjoEiztpC7of5NLmJNjcFg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8486393690109253},{"business_id":"jQPg8OKiSVa-fwvd-XGzLQ","photo_id":"xFJb2unPnqvMutpXCVkvug","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/xFJb2unPnqvMutpXCVkvug.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8315032720565796}]},"notebook_case":null}
